{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "PiCrawler — Learned Gait-Option Selection (Phase 8 A2.1)",
    "description": "Phase 8 Rung A2 — the action-vocabulary fix for A1's flat-landscape failure-to-converge.  A GaitSelector does graded REINFORCE over a small library of multi-tick GAIT primitives (options), each a posture-index sequence over an extended propulsive posture vocabulary.  Each tick the active gait's current posture index streams on intent.override; the whole-body Premotor (intent_channel=-1, mc_lr=0 -> pure EXECUTOR, no self-learning) emits that posture's 12 channels.  When a gait completes, GaitSelector credits it by the return accrued over its window: W.row(g) += lr*advantage*(1{g=sel}-dist[g])*latent.  THIS is the temporal credit A1 lacked.\n\nPosture vocabulary (5, propulsive gait-phase keyframes; u in [-1,1]): 0=STAND (hip2=0.7,knee=0.3), 1=trotA (diag FL+RR SWING hip1=+0.5/hip2=0.2, FR+RL STANCE hip1=-0.5/hip2=0.8), 2=trotB (mirror), 3=crouch (hip2=0.3), 4=push (hip2=0.9,knee=0.4).  Swing protracts (+hip1) while stance retracts (-hip1) -> alternating power stroke for translation; direction sign is empirical (max_distance is sign-agnostic).\n\nGait library (4 options): G0 stand_hold [0]x20; G1 trot [1]x14+[2]x14 (cadence sized so the rate-limiter completes each stroke); G2 trot_fast [1]x8+[2]x8; G3 pronk [4]x8+[3]x8.  GaitSelector learns which earns the most outward-progress reward.\n\nforce_gait_id=-1 = learned.  Set >=0 (e.g. 1) for open-loop feasibility / UI probe of a single gait.  Curriculum: picrawler_stand_walk_distance.json.",
    "env_target": "picrawler",
    "phase_tag": "v8.A2.1 gait-option-selector",
    "derived_from_manifest": true,
    "episode_length": 6000,
    "mc_episode_period": 1500,
    "stability_gain": 0.05,
    "stability_y_norm": 0.5,
    "stability_speed": 0.05,
    "reward_shape": "trapezoid",
    "target_height": 0.085,
    "height_penalty_grace": 0.02,
    "height_penalty_scale": 0.03,
    "height_penalty_gain": 0.05,
    "leg_symmetry": "lr_pairs"
  },
  "version": 1,
  "runtime": {
    "thread_pool": "per_instance",
    "num_threads": 0
  },
  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "neuro",
      "type": "NeurochemState",
      "params": {
        "da_baseline": 0.2,
        "ht_baseline": 0.65,
        "da_decay": 0.88,
        "ht_decay": 0.93,
        "intrinsic_da_gain": 0.05,
        "event_coupled_da": true,
        "event_coupled_ht": true,
        "da_baseline_ema_alpha": 0.001,
        "wall_stuck_da_drain": 0.0,
        "wall_stuck_ht_drain": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "epm_imu",
      "type": "EPM",
      "params": {
        "modality_group": "vestibular",
        "modality_name": "imu",
        "encoder_kind": "rbf",
        "input_topic": "reality.proprio.imu",
        "projection_dim": 32,
        "proprio_state_dims": 4,
        "baking_threshold": 50,
        "min_insertion_error": 0.02,
        "predicted_pathway_steps": 3,
        "subtract_descending_prediction": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "epm_joints",
      "type": "EPM",
      "params": {
        "modality_group": "proprio",
        "modality_name": "joints",
        "encoder_kind": "rbf",
        "input_topic": "reality.proprio.joints",
        "projection_dim": 48,
        "proprio_state_dims": 12,
        "baking_threshold": 50,
        "min_insertion_error": 0.02,
        "predicted_pathway_steps": 3,
        "subtract_descending_prediction": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "epm_compass",
      "type": "EPM",
      "params": {
        "modality_group": "compass",
        "modality_name": "global",
        "encoder_kind": "rbf",
        "input_topic": "reality.proprio.compass",
        "projection_dim": 48,
        "proprio_state_dims": 2,
        "baking_threshold": 50,
        "min_insertion_error": 0.02,
        "predicted_pathway_steps": 3,
        "subtract_descending_prediction": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voter_0",
      "type": "LateralVoter",
      "params": {
        "level": 0,
        "input_pattern": "reality.",
        "trust_epsilon": 0.05,
        "group_balance": true,
        "priority_group": "vestibular"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "descend",
      "type": "DescendingPredictor",
      "params": {
        "consensus_topic": "consensus.0",
        "targets": [
          "reality.vestibular.imu",
          "reality.proprio.joints"
